    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d589-a16">

                <pb facs="0555" n="481" xml:id="pg481"/>

                <head>No. 16.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram,— <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1865-02-08">February 8, 1865</date>—9 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>To <hi rendition="#italic">United Stales Chargé d’Affaires, Paris:</hi></p>
                <p>The Stonewall is the same as what was called the Stoerkodder at Bordeaux, and
                    Olinde at Quiberon. Her crew is the old crew of the corsair Florida,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>PERRY, <hi rendition="#italic">Chargé d’Affaires.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
